    "test": {
        "alias": ["wip"],
        "help": "Run diagnostics and maintenance tasks.",
        "category": "Owner",
        "arguments": "[gc | diagnostic | regenerate champion [patch] | regenerate aggregates [type] | pushsamplegame [GameQueueType] | retrieveallgames <summoner> | retrieveallgamesfast <summoner> | fix-timeline <puuid> | fix-timeline-patch <patch> | export-match-search]",
        "longhelp": "Owner diagnostics and maintenance. API key generation and revocation are restricted to Untouchables and Epria.\ngc requests JVM garbage collection.\nfix-timeline <puuid> and fix-timeline-patch <patch> rebuild stored match timelines.\nretrieveallgames <summoner> and retrieveallgamesfast <summoner> queue match history imports.\nexport-match-search rebuilds the Mongo match_facets projection.\nregenerate champion [patch] also accepts champions. It rebuilds played queues for the selected patch, recomputes statistics and invalidates Redis. The default is the current patch, as with the daily 23:00 job.\nregenerate aggregates [type] queues aggregate rebuilds. Types are all, leaderboard-counts, rank-distribution, top-regions, division-counts, record-counts and metrics."
    },

